{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_161_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_161","textTraditional":"一、十有一年，春，王正月，作三軍。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_161_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_161","textTraditional":"作，為也。古者天子六師，諸侯一軍。作三軍，非正也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_161_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_161","textTraditional":"二、夏，四月，四卜郊，不從，乃不郊。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_161_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_161","textTraditional":"夏四月，不時也。四卜，非禮也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_161_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_161","textTraditional":"三、鄭公孫舍之帥師侵宋。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_161_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_161","textTraditional":"四、公會晉侯、宋公、衞侯、曹伯、齊世子光、莒子、邾子、滕子、薛伯、杞伯、小邾子伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_161_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_161","textTraditional":"五、秋，七月，己未，同盟於京城北。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_161_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_161","textTraditional":"六、公至自伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_161_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_161","textTraditional":"不以後致，盟後復伐鄭也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_161_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_161","textTraditional":"七、楚子、鄭伯伐宋。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_161_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_161","textTraditional":"八、公會晉侯、宋公、衞侯、曹伯、齊世子光、莒子、邾子、滕子、薛伯、杞伯、小邾子伐鄭，會於蕭魚。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_161_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_161","textTraditional":"九、公至自會。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_161_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_161","textTraditional":"伐而後會，不以伐鄭致，得鄭伯之辭也。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_161_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_161","textTraditional":"十、楚人執鄭行人良霄。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_161_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_161","textTraditional":"行人者，挈國之辭也。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_clt_161_16","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_161","textTraditional":"十一、冬，秦人伐晉。","sentenceOrder":16}],"overrides":{}}